# RAG embedding artifacts (Makefile RAG_ARTIFACTS, default artifacts/rag).
# `vectors-{sha8}.copy` is a multi-megabyte dump of the whole corpus, and its
# sidecar `vectors-{sha8}.json` pins the model, the HF revision and the
# over-ceiling exemptions of a specific GPU run. NEITHER may be committed: the
# dump is a derived artifact of a SHA-pinned corpus (re-embeddable at will) and
# the sidecar describes one machine's environment, so a committed copy goes
# stale silently while still looking authoritative. `gee-backend/.gitignore`
# already has a blanket `*.json`, but that only ever applies to UNTRACKED files
# — it is not a safety net for a `git add -f`, which is why the directory itself
# is ignored here.
gee-backend/artifacts/

